warning[P2G4004]: lookahead `(?!#)` is not available in Go's `regexp` package
  --> logwatch.pl:88:28
   |
88 |     next unless $line =~ /^(?!#)\s*(\S+)\s+(\d+)/;
   |                            ^^^^^
   |
   = converted: the pattern compiles with `github.com/dlclark/regexp2`, which
                backtracks
   = cost: linear-time matching is no longer guaranteed; a 5s match timeout is
           set on the compiled pattern
   = try: drop the lookahead and test the surrounding text with
          `strings.HasPrefix` or a second match
   = learn: regexp-is-re2   (perl2go explain regexp-is-re2)
   = learn: mustcompile-pattern   (perl2go explain mustcompile-pattern)
